{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"3eb92608e9086668","type":"group","x":-360,"y":-1409,"width":2179,"height":2089,"label":"DSv4.1  Small-head sparse decode"},
		{"id":"657d7deabd6c6b44","type":"text","text":"#### **SGL Day0 DeepSeek V4.1**\n\n\nhttps://lmsys.org/blog/2026-09-10-deepseek-v41/\n\nhttps://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8NPrTwySrua2p5LwiEDqWQ","x":-2476,"y":-2944,"width":320,"height":234,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"f26ab6af4b0da63d","type":"text","text":"#### V3\n- MLA注意力，KV用一个512维的latent表示\n- 256选8+1共享，MTP","x":-1971,"y":-2984,"width":295,"height":140},
		{"id":"4afa6a67922c97d1","type":"text","text":"#### V3.2\n- DSA，indexer打分，topk=2048","x":-1584,"y":-2964,"width":348,"height":85},
		{"id":"d722df1f10cf2de3","type":"text","text":"#### V4\n- SWA：最近128个token滑窗\n- C4: 每4个touken压缩成1个，选512个\n- C128：每128个token压缩成1个\n- 残差用mHC\n- 专家权重用FP4","x":-1129,"y":-3011,"width":419,"height":180},
		{"id":"e065ed58278c89ba","type":"text","text":"#### V4.1 Flash\n- 384专家选6个+1共享\n- 专家用FP4\n- 每一层都有SWA\n- 0-20层： 2个token压缩成一个latent\n- 20-40层：每个token都压缩成一个latent\n- 压缩表示存fp4\n- **跨层共享**：压缩KV和检索结果\n- Engram查表","x":-1129,"y":-3615,"width":493,"height":340},
		{"id":"0bb518c2279bbceb","type":"file","file":"AI infra 学习/推理框架的探讨/Sglang vs. vLLM的算子接入：Small-head decode atten为例.md","x":-102,"y":-1389,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cd922228bb4e70e3","type":"text","text":"##### SM100：最接近 vLLM PR 的实现\nSGLang 有一个专门的 [`decode_attention_sm100.py`](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/python/sglang/kernels/ops/attention/dsv4/decode_attention_sm100.py)，其描述就是：\n> SM100 small-batch paged attention with heads on MMA N dimension\n\n当前约束包括：\n- DeepSeek V4.1；\n- SM100；\n- 16 个真实 local heads；\n- batch/token 数不超过 8；\n- BF16 query；\n- head dimension 512；\n- 专用 V4 KV cache layout。\n\n它也会把 key 范围分块，产生 partial output、max、sum，最后归并，算法结构和 vLLM PR 的 Split-K + online softmax/LSE merge 非常接近。\n\n不过这是 Blackwell 路径，不会覆盖 H20/H100/H200。\n\n- 最早是这个swapab_attention，后面又重命名为decode_attention_sm100。用Gluon实现的\n- [[DSV4.1] Use native 16-head attention for small TP4 decode batches by BBuf · Pull Request #39674 · sgl-project/sglang](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/39674)","x":-137,"y":-696,"width":320,"height":200},
		{"id":"5e56c9ac550c7203","type":"text","text":"#### DSv4.1  Small-head sparse decode on SM90\n[[Perf][DSv4.1] Small-head sparse decode on SM90 by luoyuctl · Pull Request #59418 · vllm-project/vllm](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59418)","x":-282,"y":-320,"width":245,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ab09145d979a35c7","type":"text","text":"在 SM90 架构上，FlashMLA 的稀疏解码分块以 64 为单位查询头（即 WGMMA 的 M 维度）。**DeepSeek V4.1 在 TP8 分布式切分下仅拥有 8 个注意力头（TP4 下为 16 个）**，因此需要将其填充至 64 个头，张量核心的大部分算力都消耗在填充运算上。\n","x":325,"y":-660,"width":415,"height":127},
		{"id":"144ecb5b68f593fd","type":"text","text":"#### 这个 PR 最值得学习的地方\n\n第一，优化目标非常具体。它没有笼统地说“写一个更快的 attention”，而是找到：\n\n```\nSM90 + sparse decode + 小 head + 低 token 数\n```\n\n这一块明确的性能空洞。\n\n第二，优化维度发生了转换：\n```\n浪费的 head 并行\n        ↓\n有效的 key-split 并行\n```\n\n第三，分流策略来源于测量，而不是凭经验固定一个配置。\n\n第四，保留成熟 kernel 作为 fallback。新实现只覆盖自己有优势的区域，所以几乎不承担高并发回退风险。\n\n第五，它把 kernel、运行时 dispatch、JIT warmup、CUDA Graph、正确性测试和端到端 benchmark 当成一个整体。这比单独写一个 Triton kernel 更接近真实生产优化。","x":-240,"y":219,"width":406,"height":183},
		{"id":"27b47f7de46cf52b","type":"text","text":"**merge_splits_kernel 合并**","x":1155,"y":-450,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6992622efb02919a","type":"text","text":"**选择两个kernel的实现，而不是一个kernel**","x":1539,"y":-483,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3b72b754036baf13","type":"text","text":"**为什么 token 多了以后减少 splits？**\n\n因为 splits 并非免费：\n- 每个 split 都要独立 gather/dequant\n- 要写 FP32 partial output 和 LSE\n- 后面还有一次 merge kernel\n- split 越多，调度和内存开销越大\n\n低 token 数时，需要更多 split 填满 GPU；token 数增加后，本身已经有足够并行度，就应减少 split。","x":1284,"y":158,"width":515,"height":161},
		{"id":"9c42458ff7c6e744","type":"file","file":"AI infra 学习/attachments/Pasted image 20261016152948.png","x":1284,"y":-80,"width":479,"height":189},
		{"id":"7723c69f38839577","type":"text","text":"该内核在**小batch场景**下速度更快的原因：当每步仅有少量解码 token 时，FlashMLA **为每个 token 启动一个 CTA**，每个 CTA 要针对 8 个真实注意力头执行 64 个头的计算量，GPU 并行度不足，而且大量 head 是 padding\n\n而这个新内核会启动 **token 数 × Split数** 的进程：\n- token 数≤3 时采用 32 路拆分；\n- token数 >3且<8时，采用16路拆分；\n- 但 token >=8 个时，仍沿用 FlashMLA。","x":555,"y":-1,"width":511,"height":220},
		{"id":"d22b0afb4cff84e7","type":"text","text":"Triton kernel 如果在首个线上请求中临时编译，会造成很明显的延迟尖峰。\n\n这个 PR 在 attention 初始化阶段注册：\n- 8/16 heads\n- 有无 extra/compressed cache\n- 普通 SWA 宽度\n- DSpark speculative decoding 对应的 SWA 宽度\n- 8、16、32 三种 split merge\n- 不同 page size\n\n**因此 serving 请求进入时，相关 kernel 已经编译。**\n\n**PR 报告的结果是：**\n- warmup阶段，编译 8 个 decode variant 和 3 个 merge variant\n- 单 GPU 大约增加 2.3 秒 warmup\n- 后续 92 个请求没有出现新 kernel 编译\n\n","x":528,"y":358,"width":538,"height":260,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a1c0e08ec4b07d46","type":"text","text":"这是这个 PR 很值得学习的一点：高性能 kernel 不只要“跑得快”，还要被完整纳入服务启动和 CUDA Graph 生命周期。","x":1170,"y":540,"width":510,"height":78},
		{"id":"90a3d75ae458fe14","type":"text","text":"#### 8卡H20上的Deepseek-v4.1优化\n\n[(25 封私信) 8 卡 H20 上的 DeepSeek-V4.1 优化实录：512K 首字加速 12.7 倍 - 知乎](https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2091195037786888123)","x":-1020,"y":-240,"width":250,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c98f63513586fce1","type":"text","text":"这不表示**整个 kernel** 有 87.5% 的运行时间都浪费了，但在小 batch decode、计算并行度不足时，这部分无效 tensor-core 工作会很显眼。","x":326,"y":-860,"width":332,"height":115},
		{"id":"596c63c973375bdd","type":"text","text":"**为什么 Q 和 output 仍然是 64 heads**\n\n虽然新 kernel 只处理前 8 或 16 个 heads，但接口仍然是：\n\n```\nq:   [T, 64, 512]\nout: [T, 64, 512]\n```\n\n原因是：\n\n- prefill 仍然走 FlashMLA\n- 外层 attention wrapper 仍按 padded-head 布局分配张量\n- 新 kernel 只读取和写入前 `num_heads`\n- padding 部分保持不动\n\n这让优化可以局部插入 decode 路径，不需要改动模型其他部分的数据布局","x":1123,"y":-282,"width":497,"height":122},
		{"id":"da183bc650fbc878","type":"text","text":"**每个split做online softmax**\n- 每个 program 负责一个 `(token, split)`，内部处理最多 16 个 heads。","x":1114,"y":-640,"width":466,"height":107},
		{"id":"fcd7e83bea224a42","type":"text","text":"本次新增了一个 Triton 稀疏解码内核，以 16 为单位对注意力头分块，使用 tl.dot（mma.sync）计算，直接读取已打包的 FP8 MLA 缓存；通过**K-split**恢复并行度。","x":582,"y":-480,"width":423,"height":120},
		{"id":"1f5e3f8e5d876d64","type":"text","text":"**load_kv_block()** 每次gather BLOCK_N 个 sparse key\n- 每个 token 的 `fp8_ds_mla` cache 逻辑上占 584 字节（nope fp8: 448 + rope bf16:128 + scale: 8）\n- 读nope，读scale，转bf32，分组乘scale反量化\n- 读rope，转bf32； 和nope拼接，每个token 512\n- 存 bf16\n- 既是K，又是V","x":1101,"y":-860,"width":479,"height":200},
		{"id":"1f7b47c7fb5dd7b7","type":"text","text":"## Engram","x":-214,"y":-3105,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"aa3100464aea3009","type":"text","text":"### 有界重放","x":-255,"y":-2851,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f3651ffe7aa8c1ff","type":"text","text":"不存窗口（128），需要时重算","x":106,"y":-3025,"width":278,"height":50},
		{"id":"796e37a33d3f8a7b","type":"file","file":"AI infra 学习/attachments/Pasted image 20261019124215.png","x":245,"y":-2831,"width":400,"height":294},
